### 1. Actuator Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. User Signup
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sowmya Tech",
  "email": "candidate@beamacademy.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. User Login (Copy the returned token to use in Authorization header)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidate@beamacademy.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Dashboard Stats
GET http://localhost:8081/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Toggle Course Topic Completion (Java / SQL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/courses/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "java",
  "topicId": "java-streams",
  "completed": true
}

### 7. Get User Course Progress
GET http://localhost:8081/api/courses/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Submit DSA Problem Attempt
POST http://localhost:8081/api/dsa/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patternId": "two-pointers",
  "problemTitle": "Two Sum II - Input Array Is Sorted",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "hintsUsed": 1,
  "notes": "Used two pointer approach starting from left and right boundaries with O(N) time and O(1) space."
}

### 9. Get DSA Attempts History
GET http://localhost:8081/api/dsa/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Submit Aptitude Quiz Attempt
POST http://localhost:8081/api/aptitude/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Quantitative",
  "totalQuestions": 5,
  "score": 4,
  "timeSpentSeconds": 180
}

### 11. Get Aptitude Attempts History
GET http://localhost:8081/api/aptitude/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Save Interview Practice / Self-Assessment
POST http://localhost:8081/api/interview/practices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Java Core",
  "questionTitle": "Why is String immutable in Java and what are its memory implications?",
  "status": "CONFIDENT",
  "userNotes": "String pool caching, security in classloading & networking, thread safety by default."
}

### 13. Get Interview Practices History
GET http://localhost:8081/api/interview/practices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Get Unified Progress & Readiness Metrics
GET http://localhost:8081/api/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Get or Create Personalized Study Plan
GET http://localhost:8081/api/study-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Update Study Plan
POST http://localhost:8081/api/study-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetWeeks": 6,
  "currentDay": 12,
  "focusArea": "DSA & Spring Boot Backend Microservices"
}

### 17. Get Resume Profile
GET http://localhost:8081/api/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. Save Resume Profile
POST http://localhost:8081/api/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetRole": "Java Backend Developer",
  "skills": "Java 17, Spring Boot, MySQL, REST APIs, Hibernate/JPA, Microservices, Git",
  "summary": "Junior Software Engineer with strong foundation in Java, Spring Boot RESTful microservices, and database optimization."
}

### 19. Ask AI Placement Coach (Supports live OpenAI or deterministic fallback)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/coach
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the key differences between HashMap and ConcurrentHashMap?",
  "context": "Java Collections Interview Preparation"
}